<title>USA: Redwood sets new 10 pct stock buyback.</title>
<headline>Redwood sets new 10 pct stock buyback.</headline>
<dateline>REDWOOD FALLS, Minn. 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Redwood Financial Inc said Thursday it completed a 10 percent stock repurchase program and approved a similar buyback of an additional 10 percent of outstanding shares.</p>
<p>The holding company for Redwood Falls Federal Savings and Loan Association said it bought back 106,875 shares of 1.1 million shares outstanding, as authorized on November 7.</p>
<p>It currently has 961,875 shares outstanding. The newest authorization calls for the repurchase of 96,187 shares, subject to approval from the Office of Thrift Supervision.</p>
<p>		((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
